#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:8
#: 52185d2369854317a5034d58182828f3
msgid "Pix32 v5"
msgstr "Pix32 v5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:15
#: da32bbf0731440478b3dd2c1feda9a12
msgid "System Features"
msgstr "系统特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:17
#: 381052851ec34bc79ec1d706e71b2b88
msgid ""
"HolyBro Pix32 v5 is a new autopilot developed on the base of FMUv5 scheme, "
"which can be regarded as a variant version of 'Pixhawk4'."
msgstr "HolyBro Pix32 v5 是基于 FMUv5 方案开发的新型飞控，可视为 「Pixhawk4」 的变体版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:20
#: 816c1edfe188434d8671b9e9cdc751e5
msgid ""
"The Pix32 v5 is comprised of a separate autopilot and carrier board which "
"are connected by a 100pin connector. It is designed for those pilots who "
"need a high power, flexible and customizable flight control system."
msgstr "Pix32 v5 由独立的飞控和底板组成，通过 100 针连接器相连。专为需要高性能、灵活且可定制飞控系统的飞手设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:24
#: 54031e4348544c3884a14c1cf0a0a308
msgid ""
"Holybro offers two variations of the carrier board, including an ultra "
"compact \"Mini\" version."
msgstr "Holybro 提供两种底板变体，包括超紧凑的 「Mini」 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:26
#: fbf575a029844473b4fa6e1a375a623e
msgid "Manufacturers can design  carrier boards to suit their specific needs."
msgstr "制造商可根据具体需求设计定制底板。"

