msgstr "USB 电压输入：4.75~5.25V（为所有底板 5V 输出供电，受限于 USB 电源能力）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:66
#: 4a9275c55d964f1a8a3fffb654c7b09f
msgid ""
"Servo Rail Input: 0~36V; servo rail isolated from other internal components "
"and requires its own supply)"
msgstr "舵机排输入：0~36V；舵机排与其他内部组件隔离，需独立供电）"

