#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:84
#: c2906534324742089fc50bd6bbb05a9e
msgid "Carrier board pin assignments"
msgstr "底板引脚分配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:85
#: 288ffc2f331947f3aa7689a809e656c1
msgid ""
"This section details the pin assignments of the standard and mini carrier "
"board. OEMs can design their own carrier board, as needed for specific "
"requirements. Design schematics, module connector and pinout, 3D printer "
"files, etc. are located `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/Schematics/tree/master/Holybro/Pix32-V5>`__."
msgstr ""
"本节详述标准底板和 Mini 底板的引脚分配。OEM 可根据具体需求设计定制底板。设计原理图、模块连接器和引脚图、3D 打印文件等位于 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/Schematics/tree/master/Holybro/Pix32-V5>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v5.rst:87
#: dadb4a2bc9f4470aababfd3c37970ef2
msgid ""
"VDD_5V_RC is provided when either the USB or Power Module supply is "
"attached. The power module will supply all 5V outputs except the VDD_SERVO "
"which should be provided from a separate source, like an ESC or standalone "
"BEC."
msgstr ""
"当 USB 或电源模块供电时，VDD_5V_RC 均可提供。电源模块将为所有 5V 输出供电，但 VDD_SERVO 除外，该输出需由独立电源（如 "
"ESC 或独立 BEC）供电。"

